{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight enemies to the beat and bring back rock to the streets in this epic rhythm game! <strong><i>Echo Rift</i></strong> is a 3D grid based rhythm game where players control Echo, as they fight to bring back Rock music to a monophonic world. This game was developed as part of the University of Utah's Division of Games Masters' Program 2024-2025 Thesis Project, in which a thirty person student ran studio developed and published this game from scratch over the course of eight months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Echo always wondered why they felt different in this world, why they always felt a beat that everyone else could not hear. One day they tried to bring a new type of music to the world, and that's when the world fought back. Will you be able to help Echo in their quest to bring Rock to the people?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An amazing soundtrack full of amazing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun grid based fighting encounters\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat infused gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Head bobbing action</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563460?t=1744747147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563460/bdb3c1ffb9bf45803cfba81d0262d58b8ed9d51d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744747147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563460/1045ae5c21447975517f30b3e153bedb9a7353ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744747147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563460/1045ae5c21447975517f30b3e153bedb9a7353ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744747147","categories":[{"desc